<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: netrunner -->
  <OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.netrunner.label>网络行者</OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.netrunner.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} flows through firewalls and protocols like water—faster than most can blink. -->
  <OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.netrunner.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 如水流般穿越防火墙和协议——比大多数人眨眼更快。</OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.netrunner.description>
  <!-- EN: cyber tinker -->
  <OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.cyber_tinker.label>赛博修补匠</OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.cyber_tinker.label>
  <!-- EN: Curious and clever, {PAWN_nameDef} can pull systems apart and put them back better than before—most of the time. -->
  <OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.cyber_tinker.description>好奇而聪明，{PAWN_nameDef} 能够拆解系统并将其恢复得比以前更好——大多数时候如此。</OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.cyber_tinker.description>
  <!-- EN: script kiddie -->
  <OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.script_kiddie.label>脚本小子</OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.script_kiddie.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} knows just enough to poke at systems—but lacks the chops to crack the real code. -->
  <OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.script_kiddie.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 只知道足够多的知识来捣鼓系统——但缺乏破解真正代码的能力。</OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.script_kiddie.description>
  <!-- EN: terminal hazard -->
  <OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.terminal_hazard.label>终端危险</OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.terminal_hazard.label>
  <!-- EN: When {PAWN_nameDef} touches a console, it's only a matter of time before something breaks—badly. -->
  <OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.terminal_hazard.description>当 {PAWN_nameDef} 触摸控制台时，某些东西损坏只是时间问题——而且会很严重。</OEIdeoHacking.degreeDatas.terminal_hazard.description>
  
  <!-- EN: lawbringer -->
  <OEIdeoPower.degreeDatas.lawbringer.label>执法者</OEIdeoPower.degreeDatas.lawbringer.label>
  <!-- EN: With a gaze like a loaded rifle, {PAWN_nameDef} brings order to chaos—but the burden of justice weighs heavy. -->
  <OEIdeoPower.degreeDatas.lawbringer.description>带着如装弹步枪般的凝视，{PAWN_nameDef} 为混乱带来秩序——但正义的负担很沉重。</OEIdeoPower.degreeDatas.lawbringer.description>
  <!-- EN: soft-spoken deputy -->
  <OEIdeoPower.degreeDatas.softspoken_deputy.label>温和副手</OEIdeoPower.degreeDatas.softspoken_deputy.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} keeps the peace with a light touch, avoiding conflict—but lacks the grit to lay down the law. -->
  <OEIdeoPower.degreeDatas.softspoken_deputy.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 以温和的方式维持和平，避免冲突——但缺乏严格执行法律的坚韧。</OEIdeoPower.degreeDatas.softspoken_deputy.description>
  
  <!-- EN: ardent preacher -->
  <OEIdeoSpread.degreeDatas.ardent_preacher.label>热忱传教士</OEIdeoSpread.degreeDatas.ardent_preacher.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} spreads beliefs with burning zeal—but sometimes burns too hot, even for {PAWN_pronoun}self. -->
  <OEIdeoSpread.degreeDatas.ardent_preacher.description>{PAWN_nameDef} 以炽热的热情传播信仰——但有时过于激烈，甚至对 {PAWN_pronoun} 自己也是如此。</OEIdeoSpread.degreeDatas.ardent_preacher.description>
  <!-- EN: quiet soul -->
  <OEIdeoSpread.degreeDatas.quiet_soul.label>安静灵魂</OEIdeoSpread.degreeDatas.quiet_soul.label>
  <!-- EN: Calm and steady, {PAWN_nameDef} rarely stirs conflict—but struggles to inspire deep conviction in others. -->
  <OEIdeoSpread.degreeDatas.quiet_soul.description>冷静而稳定，{PAWN_nameDef} 很少引发冲突——但难以激发他人的深层信念。</OEIdeoSpread.degreeDatas.quiet_soul.description>
  
</LanguageData>